Error [E3401]: `print` is not allowed in comptime code
  --> pure_fn_comptime_block_is_excluded_from_runtime_check.jet:4:9
    |
  4 |         print("build-time only")
    |         ^^^^^
 Why: `print` touches the outside world, so it can't run while compiling
 Fix: Compute this at runtime instead; the exceptions are `embed_file("path")`, `embed_bytes("path")`, and `find("glob")`
 Denial: comptime
 Call chain: print
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3401
